# Local working material, not part of the site.
# Skills/ holds third-party-licensed agent instructions. Thmanyah-Font-Family/
# is the full vendor download (.otf masters, licence PDFs, specimen guide) and
# is not needed to build. Only the six .woff2 files next/font/local resolves at
# compile time are committed, under src/fonts/thmanyah/ — without them the
# build fails with "Module not found".
/Skills/
/Thmanyah-Font-Family/
